{"articleNo":"224779","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=224779&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [국제] 제161회 5월 17일 모의토익 시험 고사장 안내(규정 신분증 확인)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.05.16","hit":"12876","attachments":[{"name":"2019년 제161회 5월 17일 모의토익시험 고사장 홈페이지 공지.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=224779&attachNo=79797"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">【</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">제</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">161</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">회 5월 17일 모의토익 시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">】</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">시험 일자&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">: 2019. 5. 17. (</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">금</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">) 18시30분</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt;\">※ 제 161회 5월 24일 모의토익 시험 고사장 안내는 5월 23일 예정입니다.</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><br></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">응시생들은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">18</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">시 1</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">0</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">분까지&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">해당 고사실로 입실하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">.</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">필기 도구&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">연필,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">샤프, 볼펜, 사인펜&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">인적사항은 볼펜, 사인펜만 가능</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">)</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">인정 신분증 (학생증 불가)</span></p><p><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\">▶</span></span></span>규정 신분증</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\">주민증록증</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">운전면허증</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">경찰청 발행</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">기간 만료 전의 여권</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">공무원증</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">장애인 복지 카드</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\">▶</span></span></span>대체 가능 증명서</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\">해당 동사무소에서 발급한 기간 만료 전의&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">주민등록증 발급신청 확인서</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">를 발급 받아오시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">위 규정에 명시되지 않은 신분증 및 유효기간이 지난 신분증은 토익 규정 신분증으로 인정하지 않습니다</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 13px;\"><u style=\"font-family: null;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">학생증은 규정 신분증이 아니므로 시험 응시가 절대 불가</span></span></u></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;\">하니 이점 유의하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">*&nbsp;사진으로 찍은 신분증&nbsp;인정 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">* 시험 끝나고 가지고 오는 것 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">* 원스톱에 등재하지 않고 성적 확인만 하는 것도 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 11px;\">* 무조건 규정 신분증이 아니면 즉시 퇴실조치! (예외 없음)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">입실 시간&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">: <u><strong>18</strong></u></span><u><strong><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">시 1</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">0</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">분 까지! (이후 입실통제 및 시험응시 불가)</span></strong></u></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">첨부파일의 해당 고사실을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\"><strong>본인 이름이 없는 경우 국제교류교육원으로 문의하시기 바랍니다</strong></span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">Tel. 054-478-7959</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; margin-right: 30pt; margin-left: 30pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">결과확인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">캠퍼스에듀</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px;\">(<strong><a href=\"http://kum.ttceducation.net/\"></a><u><a href=\"http://kum.ttceducation.net/\"><strong><font color=\"#0066cc\">http://kum.ttceducation.net</font></strong></a></u></strong></span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">회원가입 후 로그인</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
